<title>JAPAN: CHIYODA LIFE SAYS TO BOOST CAPITAL BASE TO Y51 BLN.</title>
<headline>CHIYODA LIFE SAYS TO BOOST CAPITAL BASE TO Y51 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiyoda Mutual Life Insurance Co said on Wednesday it would raise funds totalling 50 billion yen to boost its capital base to 51 billion yen from the current one billion yen.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the Japanese life insurer said the fund-raising plan was expected to strengthen its capital.</p>
<p>He did not elaborate further.</p>
</text>
